rrent cell, (<code>i</code>, <code>j</code>):</p>
<blockquote>
<p><code>if matrix[i][j] =3D=3D 1: max_square(i, j) =3D 1 + min(max_square(=
i - 1, j), max_square(i - 1, j - 1), max_square(i, j - 1))</code></p>
