<blockquote>
<p><code>if matrix[i][j] =3D=3D 1: dp[i][j] =3D 1 + min(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i =
- 1][j - 1], dp[i][j - 1])</code></p>
</blockquote>
<p>Now, let's think about what the base cases should be.</p>
<p><strong>Base cases</strong><br>
